{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅くなってごめんなさい\nまずは...\n京都で全国握手会がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペア〜はマイマイっ！(深川まいちゃん)\nでしたー！最年少と最年長ペア〜ですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイは癒し系なので凄く癒されましたっ！ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイファンの方も優しくしてくれて有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいんでもらえたかな!?\nまあやはどうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら感想を聞かせて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まあや族の方も来てくれて本当に有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいのと、やっぱりホッとしました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり握手会はドキドキもあるけど、大好きな人達が直接逢って話が出来るし、\n握手で繋がれるから嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜そして個別握手会〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happybirthday歌ってくれたり、\n『おめでとー』とか♪\n沢山の言葉を頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃうれしかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が色々考えて言ってくれたんだと思うと...本当に嬉しくて\nサプライズも♪\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に忘れないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表ありました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは、まだまだ...\nまだ輝きや努力が足りないんだ...だから選ばれないんだ...と思っています。\n毎日、目の前にある事を１つ１つやっていくのが精一杯で\n毎日が凄い早さで過ぎて行きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと上を目指して頑張らないと\nメンバーは皆頑張ってるから、もっと頑張らないといけないけど、まあやらしさは失いたくないです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも前を向いて、上を目指して頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていてほしいです\n一緒に歩いてほしいです\nこれからもアドバイスをお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日からは15才"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや族さんにいっぱい笑顔になってもらえるように、一緒に笑顔になれるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日と違うまあやになれるように毎\nを大切な人達と一緒に成長していきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは元気だよ！\n１人じゃないもんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくれて、思ってくれる人達がいるから、\nいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや族さん、メンバー、スタッフさん\n友達、先生達、家族、今ブログを読んでくれてる人、\nまあやは沢山の人達に支えられてここまできました\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、まあやらしく、でも大きく成長していきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/23/8004414/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}